<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Silico Guard | Fire Safety Innovation</title>

<style>

* {

    margin: 0;

    padding: 0;

    box-sizing: border-box;

}

body {

    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;

    background: #0b0f14;

    color: #f5f5f5;

    line-height: 1.6;

}

a {

    text-decoration: none;

    color: inherit;

}

.container {

    width: 90%;

    max-width: 1100px;

    margin: auto;

}

/* HERO */

.hero {

    min-height: 90vh;

    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    background:

        linear-gradient(135deg, #0b0f14 55%, #17110c 100%);

    border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;

}

.hero-content {

    padding: 80px 0;

}

.label {

    color: #ff8a00;

    font-size: 14px;

    font-weight: bold;

    letter-spacing: 3px;

    margin-bottom: 20px;

}

h1 {

    font-size: 70px;

    line-height: 1;

    letter-spacing: -3px;

    margin-bottom: 25px;

}

.hero h2 {

    font-size: 25px;

    font-weight: normal;

    color: #d5d5d5;

    max-width: 700px;

    margin-bottom: 25px;

}

.hero p {

    max-width: 700px;

    color: #9fa5ad;

    font-size: 17px;

}

.buttons {

    margin-top: 35px;

    display: flex;

    gap: 15px;

    flex-wrap: wrap;

}

.button {

    padding: 14px 24px;

    border: 1px solid #ff8a00;

    background: #ff8a00;

    color: #111;

    font-weight: bold;

    border-radius: 5px;

}

.button.secondary {

    background: transparent;

    color: #fff;

}

/* STATS */

.stats {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);

    border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;

}

.stat {

    padding: 35px 20px;

    border-right: 1px solid #292929;

}

.stat:last-child {

    border-right: none;

}

.stat strong {

    display: block;

    font-size: 28px;

    color: #ff8a00;

    margin-bottom: 5px;

}

.stat span {

    color: #9299a2;

    font-size: 14px;

}

/* SECTIONS */

section {

    padding: 90px 0;

}

.section-title {

    margin-bottom: 45px;

}

.section-title span {

    color: #ff8a00;

    font-size: 13px;

    letter-spacing: 2px;

    font-weight: bold;

}

.section-title h2 {

    font-size: 42px;

    margin-top: 8px;

}

/* PROJECT CARDS */

.projects {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

    gap: 25px;

}

.card {

    background: #11161d;

    border: 1px solid #252b32;

    border-radius: 10px;

    padding: 35px;

}

.card-number {

    color: #ff8a00;

    font-size: 13px;

    font-weight: bold;

    letter-spacing: 2px;

}

.card h3 {

    font-size: 27px;

    margin: 15px 0;

}

.card p {

    color: #9fa5ad;

}

/* PROCESS */

.process {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

    gap: 20px;

}

.process-item {

    padding: 30px;

    background: #11161d;

    border-left: 3px solid #ff8a00;

}

.process-item h3 {

    margin: 10px 0;

}

.process-item p {

    color: #9fa5ad;

}

/* SAFETY */

.safety-box {

    background: #15120e;

    border: 1px solid #503512;

    padding: 35px;

    border-radius: 10px;

}

.safety-box h3 {

    color: #ff9d2e;

    margin-bottom: 12px;

}

.safety-box p {

    color: #c2c2c2;

}

/* AWARD */

.award {

    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #17120c, #101419);

    border: 1px solid #5b3b18;

    padding: 45px;

    border-radius: 10px;

}

.award-label {

    color: #ff8a00;

    font-size: 13px;

    font-weight: bold;

    letter-spacing: 2px;

}

.award h2 {

    font-size: 32px;

    margin: 12px 0;

}

.award p {

    color: #aeb4bb;

}

/* PROFILE */

.profile {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;

    gap: 50px;

}

.profile p {

    color: #aeb4bb;

    margin-bottom: 20px;

}

.skills {

    display: flex;

    flex-wrap: wrap;

    gap: 10px;

}

.skill {

    border: 1px solid #30363d;

    padding: 10px 14px;

    border-radius: 4px;

    color: #d8d8d8;

    font-size: 14px;

}

/* FOOTER */

footer {

    border-top: 1px solid #292929;

    padding: 35px 0;

    color: #777f89;

    font-size: 14px;

}

footer strong {

    color: #ff8a00;

}

/* MOBILE */

@media (max-width: 800px) {

    h1 {

        font-size: 50px;

    }

    .stats {

        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

    }

    .stat {

        border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;

    }

    .projects,

    .process,

    .profile {

        grid-template-columns: 1fr;

    }

    .section-title h2 {

        font-size: 34px;

    }

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<header class="hero">

    <div class="container hero-content">

        <div class="label">

            OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH AND SAFETY

        </div>

        <h1>SILICO<br>GUARD</h1>

        <h2>

            Fire Safety Innovation

        </h2>

        <p>

            A graduation innovation project focused on developing

            silicone-based fire safety concepts designed to support

            fire response and protection.

        </p>

        <div class="buttons">

            <a class="button" href="README.md">

                VIEW PROJECT

            </a>

            <a class="button secondary" href="#about">

                ABOUT THE CREATOR

            </a>

        </div>

    </div>

</header>

<div class="container">

    <div class="stats">

        <div class="stat">

            <strong>02</strong>

            <span>Fire Safety Concepts</span>

        </div>

        <div class="stat">

            <strong>3D</strong>

            <span>Product Design</span>

        </div>

        <div class="stat">

            <strong>01</strong>

            <span>Physical Prototype</span>

        </div>

        <div class="stat">

            <strong>2025</strong>

            <span>Project Recognition</span>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<section>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

            <span>THE CONCEPT</span>

            <h2>Two Fire Safety Concepts</h2>

        </div>

        <div class="projects">

            <div class="card">

                <div class="card-number">01</div>

                <h3>Silicone Fire Blanket</h3>

                <p>

                    A silicone-based fire blanket concept designed

                    to support fire response by helping isolate the

                    fire from oxygen.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="card">

                <div class="card-number">02</div>

                <h3>Cooling Layer Concept</h3>

                <p>

                    A second concept combining a silicone fire blanket

                    with a cooling gel layer to reduce heat sensation

                    during use.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

            <span>DEVELOPMENT</span>

            <h2>From Concept to Prototype</h2>

        </div>

        <div class="process">

            <div class="process-item">

                <div class="card-number">01</div>

                <h3>Concept</h3>

                <p>

                    Identifying a fire safety problem and developing

                    practical product concepts around it.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="process-item">

                <div class="card-number">02</div>

                <h3>3D Design</h3>

                <p>

                    Creating product models and visual representations

                    using Blender.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="process-item">

                <div class="card-number">03</div>

                <h3>Prototype</h3>

                <p>

                    Producing physical prototypes and conducting a

                    practical fire demonstration.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

            <span>SAFETY</span>

            <h2>Practical Demonstration</h2>

        </div>

        <div class="safety-box">

            <h3>Safety Precautions During Demonstration</h3>

            <p>

                Safety precautions were taken during the practical

                fire demonstration. A fire extinguisher was kept

                available as a precaution, along with additional

                emergency and backup measures.

            </p>

            <br>

            <p>

                The demonstration was a practical project test and

                was not conducted as a formal documented risk assessment.

            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section>

    <div class="container">

        <div class="award">

            <div class="award-label">

                PROJECT RECOGNITION

            </div>

            <h2>

                Outstanding Project Award

            </h2>

            <p>

                Silico Guard received recognition at the Qasim Region

                Technical and Vocational Training Excellence Award in 2025.

            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<section id="about">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="section-title">

            <span>ABOUT</span>

            <h2>Nora Alshlahi</h2>

        </div>

        <div class="profile">

            <div>

                <p>

                    Occupational Health and Safety specialist with

                    practical experience in safety inspections,

                    hazard identification, risk assessment, emergency

                    planning and workplace safety awareness.

                </p>

                <p>

                    Interested in practical safety solutions,

                    preventive measures and developing safer work

                    environments.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div>

                <div class="skills">

                    <div class="skill">OSHA 30H</div>

                    <div class="skill">IOSH Managing Safely</div>

                    <div class="skill">CIEH Level 3 UK</div>

                    <div class="skill">HAZWOPER</div>

                    <div class="skill">First Aid</div>

                    <div class="skill">Risk Management 30H</div>

                    <div class="skill">Safety Cadres</div>

                    <div class="skill">SCE Technical Membership</div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<footer>

    <div class="container">

        <strong>SILICO GUARD</strong>

        <br>

        Fire Safety Innovation Portfolio

    </div>

</footer>

</body>

</html>
